 Nimblefire.png","value_text":"File:S2E39 Dante Nimblefire.png","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Orange","value_text":"Orange","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Mobility","value_text":"Mobility","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] <br> [[Den Fears]] <br> [[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]]","value_text":"Dante Vale \n Den Fears \n Lok Lambert \n Sophie Casterwill","links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Den Fears","label":"Den Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4303","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Den_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4303"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Into the River of Secrets]]\"","value_text":"\"Into the River of Secrets\"","links":[{"target_title":"Into the River of Secrets","label":"Into the River of Secrets","target_id":"huntik:page:2642","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Into_the_River_of_Secrets","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2642"}]}],"start":0,"end":230}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] used this spell to be able to walk on water in the [[Cave of the Gargoyle|Cave of the Gargoyle.]] {{source|Into the River of Secrets}} While being pursued by [[Fenris]] in the [[Temple of Thor]], having fallen, Dante used the spell to launch himself off Fenris and get to safety. {{Source|The Legacy of Thor}}\n\nThis spell was cast by [[Sophie Casterwill]] on [[Lok Lambert]] when Dante's team attempted to pass a trap before [[Sutos Island]]. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}\n\nIn a pursuit of a [[Blood Spiral]] student, Lok used the spell to run across a canal. {{Source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}","text":"Dante Vale used this spell to be able to walk on water in the Cave of the Gargoyle. [Into the River of Secrets] While being pursued by Fenris in the Temple of Thor, having fallen, Dante used the spell to launch himself off Fenris and get to safety. [The Legacy of Thor]\n\nThis spell was cast by Sophie Casterwill on Lok Lambert when Dante's team attempted to pass a trap before Sutos Island. [Like Father, Unlike Son]\n\nIn a pursuit of a Blood Spiral student, Lok used the spell to run across a canal. [Boys Will Be Seekers]"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"*In Episode 52 - \"[[Dante's Return]]\", the coloration of Nimblefire changed to blue.","text":"*In Episode 52 - \"Dante's Return\", the coloration of Nimblefire changed to blue."},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" position=\"center\" widths=\"179\">\nFile:S1E07 Dante Nimblefire.jpg|Nimblefire manifests in Dante's eyes\nFile:S1E17 Nimblefire.jpg\nFile:S1E17 Dante Nimblefire.png\nFile:S2E36 Lok Nimblefire.png|Lok uses Nimblefire to run across a canal\nFile:S2E38 Lok Den Sophie Nimblefire.png\nS2E45 Dante 2.png\nFile:S2E52 Lok Nimblefire Willblade Cherit.png|Lok uses a blue version of Nimblefire\n</gallery>","text":"File:S1E07 Dante Nimblefire.jpg|Nimblefire manifests in Dante's eyes\nFile:S1E17 Nimblefire.jpg\nFile:S1E17 Dante Nimblefire.png\nFile:S2E36 Lok Nimblefire.png|Lok uses Nimblefire to run across a canal\nFile:S2E38 Lok Den Sophie Nimblefire.png\nS2E45 Dante 2.png\nFile:S2E52 Lok Nimblefire Willblade Cherit.png|Lok uses a blue version of Nimblefire"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT=Nimbelvuur\n|POR=Lança-chamas, Fogo Veloz\n}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Mobility spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Nimblefire is a spell that grants the caster super speed for a short time in a similar manner to the spells Hyperstride and Shadowspeed. The spell is manifested as an orange energy and often is concentrated on the legs.\n\n== History ==\nDante Vale used this spell to be able to walk on water in the Cave of the Gargoyle. [Into the River of Secrets] While being pursued by Fenris in the Temple of Thor, having fallen, Dante used the spell to launch himself off Fenris and get to safety. [The Legacy of Thor]\n\nThis spell was cast by Sophie Casterwill on Lok Lambert when Dante's team attempted to pass a trap before Sutos Island. [Like Father, Unlike Son]\n\nIn a pursuit of a Blood Spiral student, Lok used the spell to run across a canal. [Boys Will Be Seekers]\n\n== Trivia ==\n*In Episode 52 - \"Dante's Return\", the coloration of Nimblefire changed to blue.\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nFile:S1E07 Dante Nimblefire.jpg|Nimblefire manifests in Dante's eyes\nFile:S1E17 Nimblefire.jpg\nFile:S1E17 Dante Nimblefire.png\nFile:S2E36 Lok Nimblefire.png|Lok uses Nimblefire to run across a canal\nFile:S2E38 Lok Den Sophie Nimblefire.png\nS2E45 Dante 2.png\nFile:S2E52 Lok Nimblefire Willblade Cherit.png|Lok uses a blue version of Nimblefire\n\n== International Names ==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E39 Dante Nimblefire.png\n| aura  = Orange\n| class = Mobility\n| users = [[Dante Vale]] <br> [[Den Fears]] <br> [[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]]\n| first = \"[[Into the River of Secrets]]\"\n}}'''Nimblefire''' is a [[spell]] that grants the caster super speed for a short time in a similar manner to the spells [[Hyperstride]] and [[Shadowspeed]]. The spell is manifested as an orange energy and often is concentrated on the legs.\n\n== History ==\n[[Dante Vale]] used this spell to be able to walk on water in the [[Cave of the Gargoyle|Cave of the Gargoyle.]] {{source|Into the River of Secrets}} While being pursued by [[Fenris]] in the [[Temple of Thor]], having fallen, Dante used the spell to launch himself off Fenris and get to safety. {{Source|The Legacy of Thor}}\n\nThis spell was cast by [[Sophie Casterwill]] on [[Lok Lambert]] when Dante's team attempted to pass a trap before [[Sutos Island]]. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}\n\nIn a pursuit of a [[Blood Spiral]] student, Lok used the spell to run across a canal. {{Source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\n== Trivia ==\n*In Episode 52 - \"[[Dante's Return]]\", the coloration of Nimblefire changed to blue.\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" position=\"center\" widths=\"179\">\nFile:S1E07 Dante Nimblefire.jpg|Nimblefire manifests in Dante's eyes\nFile:S1E17 Nimblefire.jpg\nFile:S1E17 Dante Nimblefire.png\nFile:S2E36 Lok Nimblefire.png|Lok uses Nimblefire to run across a canal\nFile:S2E38 Lok Den Sophie Nimblefire.png\nS2E45 Dante 2.png\nFile:S2E52 Lok Nimblefire Willblade Cherit.png|Lok uses a blue version of Nimblefire\n</gallery>\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|DUT=Nimbelvuur\n|POR=Lança-chamas, Fogo Veloz\n}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Mobility spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Mobility spells","Orange-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Den Fears","label":"Den Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4303","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Den_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4303"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Into the River of Secrets","label":"Into the River of Secrets","target_id":"huntik:page:2642","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Into_the_River_of_Secrets","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2642"},{"target_title":"spell","label":"spell","target_id":"huntik:page:8063","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/spell","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8063"},{"target_title":"Hyperstride","label":"Hyperstride","target_id":"huntik:page:2004","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Hyperstride","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2004"},{"target_title":"Shadowspeed","label":"Shadowspeed","target_id":"huntik:page:2368","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Shadowspeed","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2368"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Cave of the Gargoyle","label":"Cave of the Gargoyle.","target_id":"huntik:page:2292","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Cave_of_the_Gargoyle","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2292"},{"target_title":"Fenris","label":"Fenris","target_id":"huntik:page:2971","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Fenris","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2971"},{"target_title":"Temple of Thor","label":"Temple of Thor","target_id":"huntik:page:2910","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Temple_of_Thor","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2910"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","targ